(ii) it adds two checks and a second planted bug, not one check;
(iii) the P2 planted-bug runs are full length inside the judged set, not 'a short P2 run' (a short run stays as a lab unit test);
(iv) the runs take about 46 minutes, not about 35;
(v) B1's checks only take effect with U4g's runs.
The plain words state only (i). A yes to wording and size is only informed if every change from his chosen option is stated.

